OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 13 MAY
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe Orchestre National de France
OL,6,     Gis joined by American star opera
OL,7,     Gsinger Joyce DiDonato in songs by
OL,8,     GAlma and Gustav Mahler, and it
OL,9,     Gperforms Richard Strauss's
OL,10,     GTransfiguration.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: David Munrow - The
OL,12,     FPied Piper
OL,13,     GTo many, the recorder is a modest
OL,14,     Gschool instrument. Not for David
OL,15,     GMunrow, a musical maverick of the
OL,16,     G1960s, who transformed it into a
OL,17,     Gworld of colour, curiosity and
OL,18,     Gadventure.
